UID: ETSI-OS-TH-UADT
LEVEL: B.4.8
TITLE: TH-UADT: Unauthorised access to confidential data transmitted

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
Attacker can use network access to get unauthorised access to confidential data transmitted by the product.

Assets affected: Data assets, Network assets, and Identity and access assets.

Requirements that mitigate this threat: TR-CDTX, TR-CRYP, TR-IDTX, TR-DMIN

Mitigations for Likelihood:

* Medium to Low: RRDC

* High to Low: CDTX, ENTX, CRYP, INTT, RRDC

