Attacker can masquerade as an authorised server to get unauthorised access to product assets.

Assets affected: Network assets, Identity and access assets, and Data assets.

Requirements that mitigate this threat: TR-CDTX, TR-CRYP, TR-IDTX, TR-AUTH, TR-LOGG

Mitigations for Likelihood:

