[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: ETSI-OS-TH-XUSR
LEVEL: B.4.13
TITLE: TH-XUSR: Unauthorised access, resource exhaustion, or privilege escalation between concurrent users

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
An authorised user of a product that hosts more than one user account can exploit inadequate isolation between users to gain unauthorised access to another user's data or processes, to exhaust shared resources and deny service to other users, or to acquire privileges beyond those authorised for the account.

Assets affected: Data assets, Identity and access assets, and Product functions.

Requirements that mitigate this threat: TR-ISOL, TR-AUTH, TR-AVAI, TR-LOGG

Mitigations for Likelihood:

* Medium to Low: ISO-3, ISO-4, RLIM

* High to Low: ISO-3, ISO-4, RLIM, ISO-5, ACCS, PRIV

